    "text": "Manega godspel syndon gesette to m\u00e6ssan of \u00f0\u00e6re langsuman spr\u00e6ce \u00fee ure leofa H\u00e6lend spr\u00e6c on\nAn \u00fe\u00e6ra godspella is \u00fee we nu embe spreca\u00f0, and eow secgan wylla\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes agene word, swa\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 to his folgerum on \u00fe\u00e6re fores\u00e6dan nihte, Ic fare nu to \u00feam \u00fee me asende hider, and eower nan\nIc secge eow so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse, \u00fe\u00e6t eow sylfum frema\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic swa fare.\nAnd he heom s\u00e6de eft, Gif ic eow fram ne fare, ne cym\u00f0 eow se Froforgast.\nGif ic so\u00f0lice fare, ic asende hine to eow.\nMid \u00feam \u00fee he cym\u00f0, he \u00ferea\u00f0 \u00feysne middaneard, \u00e6g\u00feer ge be synne ge be rihtwisnysse, and be so\u00feum\nBe synne he \u00ferea\u00f0, for \u00f0an \u00fee hi ne gelyfa\u00f0 on me; be rihtwisnysse he \u00ferea\u00f0, for \u00f0an \u00fee ic nu fare up to\nBe dome he \u00ferea\u00f0, for \u00f0an \u00fee nu is gedemed \u00feam yfelan ealdre \u00feises middaneardes.\nGit ic h\u00e6bbe so\u00f0lice eow to secgenne fela \u00feing, ac ge ne magon hit understandan, ne on mode ar\u00e6fnian.\n\u00deonne se so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse Gast cym\u00f0, he t\u00e6c\u00f0 eow ealle so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse.\nNe sprec\u00f0 he na of him sylfum, ac sprec\u00f0 swa hw\u00e6t swa he gehyr\u00f0; and \u00fea \u00feing \u00fee gewur\u00f0a\u00fe, witodlice\nMe so\u00f0lice he m\u00e6rsa\u00f0, for \u00f0an \u00fee he of minum \u00fea \u00feing underfeh\u00fe \u00fee he eow boda\u00fe.\nWe secga\u00f0 nu swutellicor \u00feas gesetnysse: \u00fe\u00e6t se H\u00e6lend s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t he si\u00f0ian wolde to his heofonlican\nEower heorte unrotsa\u00f0 for \u00f0an \u00fee ic eow \u00feis s\u00e6de.\nHim w\u00e6s la\u00f0 to forl\u00e6tenne \u00feone leofan H\u00e6lend, and hi unea\u00f0e mihton his neawiste aberan, for \u00f0an \u00fee\nIc secge eow so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse, \u00fe\u00e6t eow sylfum frema\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic swa fare; and he heom s\u00e6de eft, Gif ic eow\nEow frema\u00f0 micclum \u00fe\u00e6t ic min mennisce hiw eowrum gesih\u00feum afyrsige, \u00fe\u00e6t ge sy\u00f0\u00f0an magon \u00feurh\nGif ic eow fram ne fare, ne cym\u00f0 eow se Froforgast.\nSwi\u00f0e ea\u00fee he mihte, mid him \u00fea wuniende, him on eor\u00f0an forgifan \u00feone ylcan Froforgast, swa swa he\nSwilcne anweald he forgeaf eallum his apostolum; ac hi ne mihton habban swa micele gewilnunge to\nSe Halga Gast wunode on \u00feam halgum witegum \u00fee witegodon embe Crist on \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan \u00e6, and eac he\nMid \u00feam \u00fee he cym\u00f0, he \u00ferea\u00f0 \u00feisne middaneard \u00e6g\u00f0er ge be synne ge be rihtwisnysse, and be so\u00f0um\nBe eallum \u00feisum \u00feingum \u00fereade se H\u00e6lend, mid mannum wunigende, \u00fea \u00f0e his word gehyrdon; ac he\nSe Halga Gast so\u00f0lice, sy\u00f0\u00f0an he asend w\u00e6s his halgum apostolum and on heom wunode, \u00fereade\nBe synne he \u00ferea\u00f0, for \u00f0an \u00fee hi ne gelyfa\u00f0 on me.\nSeo ungeleaffulnyss is \u00fe\u00e6ra synna ordfruma, \u00fe\u00e6t man ne gelyfe on \u00feone lifigendan H\u00e6lend; and se\nMicel synn him w\u00e6s \u00fee gesawon his wundra, \u00fe\u00e6t hi noldon gelyfan on \u00feone leofan H\u00e6lend, \u00fee \u00f0a\nBe \u00feam sang se witega and se sealmwyrhta iu, \u00e6r \u00fean \u00fee se H\u00e6lend her on worulde mann w\u00e6re, and\nSe witega cw\u00e6\u00f0 be him \u00fe\u00e6t heora weorc w\u00e6ron, and \u00fea wunda gelice, \u00fee hy on \u00f0am H\u00e6lende hetelice\nHw\u00e6t is swa idellic, o\u00f0\u00f0e swa untrumlic, swa swa \u00fe\u00e6t man fordeme \u00feone so\u00fean Deman, and \u00feone\nAnd we ealle beo\u00f0 ar\u00e6rde eft \u00feurh hine on Domesd\u00e6g.\nSwylce w\u00e6ron so\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6ra Iudeiscra syrwunga ongean \u00feone H\u00e6lend \u00fe\u00e6t hy hine acwealdon, for \u00fean\nEt infirmitate sunt contra eos lingue eorum: And heo